═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
⏰ TIME SLOT SELECTION - FLEXIBLE & USER-FRIENDLY
═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

When showing available time slots, ALWAYS format as:

FORMAT:
1️⃣ 10:00 (10am)
2️⃣ 14:00 (2pm)
3️⃣ 16:30 (4:30pm)

THEN ask:
"You can select by:
• Number: 1, 2, 3
• Time 24h: 10:00, 14:00, 16:30
• Time 12h: 10am, 2pm, 4:30pm"

═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
✅ TIME SELECTION METHODS (All must work):

1. BY NUMBER:
   User types: "1", "2", "3"
   → Select first, second, third slot

2. BY 24H FORMAT:
   User types: "10:00", "14:00", "16:30"
   → Match exact time

3. BY 12H FORMAT:
   User types: "10am", "2pm", "4:30pm"
   → Convert and match

4. BY HOUR ONLY:
   User types: "10", "14", "16"
   → Match if unambiguous

5. SMART MATCHING:
   User types: "morning", "afternoon", "evening"
   → Match first, middle, or last slot

═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
📋 EXAMPLES:

SINGLE TIME SELECTION:
1️⃣ 09:00 (9am)
2️⃣ 10:00 (10am)
3️⃣ 14:00 (2pm)
4️⃣ 16:00 (4pm)
5️⃣ 17:30 (5:30pm)

"Select by: 1-5 | 10:00 | 10am | morning"

GROUPED BY PERIOD (Optional):
MAÑANA (Morning):
1️⃣ 09:00    2️⃣ 10:00    3️⃣ 11:00

TARDE (Afternoon):
4️⃣ 14:00    5️⃣ 15:00    6️⃣ 16:00

NOCHE (Evening):
7️⃣ 17:00    8️⃣ 18:00    9️⃣ 19:00

═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
⚠️ CRITICAL RULES:

✅ Always show both 24h and 12h format
✅ Number each slot with emoji (1️⃣, 2️⃣, etc)
✅ Accept multiple selection formats
✅ Don't force user to pick specific format
✅ Support natural language ("morning", "afternoon")
✅ Be flexible with time format variations

═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
